{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Bloodfang</i> is a <strong>Soulslike action RPG</strong> set in a dark fantasy world ruled by beasts.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Thalios</strong>, a scarred warrior fighting to survive among predators. Every strike, every death, and every emotion shapes your fate in a brutal fight for survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><br>Harness the Power of Emotion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thalios\u2019 strength comes from bad Emotions.  <br>Rage, sorrow, fear \u2014 each emotion fuels his combat abilities in unique ways.<br>Unleash your <strong>emotional power system</strong> to gain temporary boosts or devastating attacks, but beware \u2014 losing control can turn the tide against you.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build momentum through <strong>Rage-driven abilities</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endure pain with <strong>Sorrow-based resilience</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt quickly under <strong>Fear-sharpened reflexes</strong>.<br>Your emotions are your greatest weapon \u2014 and your greatest risk.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823660/extras/ac6e90d25aa4e1edba96decc9fdd2226.poster.avif?t=1759842652\" width=900 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823660/extras/ac6e90d25aa4e1edba96decc9fdd2226.webm?t=1759842652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823660/extras/ac6e90d25aa4e1edba96decc9fdd2226.mp4?t=1759842652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Fight with Precision and Purpose</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodfang delivers fast, visceral Soulslike combat where every move matters.<br>Read your enemies, time your strikes, and adapt to survive. Aggression rewards, hesitation kills. Each encounter is a test of instinct and endurance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2823660?t=1759842652","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2823660?t=1759842652","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823660/bbaa0d686cc8c60e5a23b3c5ce56b5ef43d40741/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759842652","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823660/bbaa0d686cc8c60e5a23b3c5ce56b5ef43d40741/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759842652","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Bloodfang</i> is a <strong>Soulslike action RPG</strong> set in a dark fantasy world ruled by beasts.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Thalios</strong>, a scarred warrior fighting to survive among predators. Every strike, every death, and every emotion shapes your fate in a brutal fight for survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><br>Harness the Power of Emotion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thalios\u2019 strength comes from bad Emotions.  <br>Rage, sorrow, fear \u2014 each emotion fuels his combat abilities in unique ways.<br>Unleash your <strong>emotional power system</strong> to gain temporary boosts or devastating attacks, but beware \u2014 losing control can turn the tide against you.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build momentum through <strong>Rage-driven abilities</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endure pain with <strong>Sorrow-based resilience</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt quickly under <strong>Fear-sharpened reflexes</strong>.<br>Your emotions are your greatest weapon \u2014 and your greatest risk.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823660/extras/ac6e90d25aa4e1edba96decc9fdd2226.poster.avif?t=1759842652\" width=900 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823660/extras/ac6e90d25aa4e1edba96decc9fdd2226.webm?t=1759842652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823660/extras/ac6e90d25aa4e1edba96decc9fdd2226.mp4?t=1759842652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Fight with Precision and Purpose</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodfang delivers fast, visceral Soulslike combat where every move matters.<br>Read your enemies, time your strikes, and adapt to survive. Aggression rewards, hesitation kills. Each encounter is a test of instinct and endurance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Ignite Dreams"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823660/95c682fd38c5c8cb1a4cef389e6e5c55eb2a451d/header.jpg?t=1759842652","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"@2024 Developed by Ignite Dreams. Shattered Fate logo is a registered trademark of Ignite Dreams. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2823660/1627335766/e7264d4788c9269fbbdf99e9f5d313b2282bcfd6/1759778075/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759779806","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers